# Descriptor: [B- -> anti-D(2S)0 l- nu, anti-D(2S)0 -> anti-D0 eta] gap mode (resonant)
# NickName: Bu_D1_2550lnu_Deta_gapmodes
# Documentation: Gap mode; D_1(2550) [= D(2S)0 in EvtGen, PDG 100421, m=2564 MeV, w=135 MeV]
#   -> D0 eta contribution to semileptonic gap (arXiv:2605.03021).
#   ISGW2 for B -> D(2S) l nu (model available in DECAY_BELLE2.DEC for this state).
#   PHSP for D(2S) -> D eta sub-decay.
# Responsible: Philipp Horak
# Email: phorak@uvic.ca
# Date: 20260519

Alias D1_2550sig anti-D(2S)0
Alias anti-D1_2550sig D(2S)0
ChargeConj D1_2550sig anti-D1_2550sig

Decay Upsilon(4S)
1.0 B-sig B+sig  VSS;
Enddecay

Decay B-sig
0.500 D1_2550sig  e-  anti-nu_e  PHOTOS ISGW2;
0.500 D1_2550sig  mu- anti-nu_mu PHOTOS ISGW2;
Enddecay
CDecay B+sig

Decay D1_2550sig
1.0   anti-D0  eta   PHSP;
Enddecay
CDecay anti-D1_2550sig

End
